          "description": "An Erbium-sponsored developmental hospital, school, and placement center providing subsidized Second Emergence treatment through long-term service agreements.",
          "gmNotes": "The campus maintains extensive behavioral, genetic, telepathic, and family-network records. Damaya and Korasha programs receive far more funding than Katalash development."
        }
      ],
      "description": "The Lashunta homeworld is a warm, biologically dense planet of towering vegetation, deep wetlands, seasonal forests, and heavily interconnected ecosystems. Natural psionic phenomena arise from the interaction of biological electrical fields, mineral deposits, atmospheric conditions, and mechanisms that remain poorly understood. A young planetary ring complicates orbital traffic and casts moving shadow bands across the biosphere.",
      "gmNotes": "Velis is formally self-governing. Settled Systems authorities and Erbium shape policy through transit certification, medical sponsorship, security cooperation, and ownership of the navigation systems needed to cross the ring safely.",
